		"name": "AtixBackEnd API",
		"description": "Complete REST API collection for AtixBackEnd - Work and Ticket Management System\n\nThis collection includes all endpoints for:\n\n- Authentication (JWT-based)\n    \n- User Management\n    \n- Client Management\n    \n- Plant Management\n    \n- Ticket Management\n    \n- Work Management\n    \n- Work Reports\n    \n- Worksite References\n    \n- File Attachments (Cloudinary)\n    \n- Dashboard (GraphQL)\n    \n\nAuthentication:\n\n- Public endpoints: /auth/register, /auth/login\n    \n- Protected endpoints: Require Bearer token from login response\n    \n\nRoles:\n\n- USER: Basic access\n    \n- ADMIN: Administrative access\n    \n- OWNER: Full access",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "49984250",
		"_collection_link": "https://marcomanfrin-1709038.postman.co/workspace/marco's-Workspace~5569ee71-1cf3-44c2-8fd7-2f130150440b/collection/49984250-fb4c9bb8-28bc-4286-b14d-cfec40ac3f72?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=49984250"
