							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"{{$randomFirstName}}\",\n  \"lastName\": \"{{$randomLastName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{$randomEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{$randomPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"OWNER\", // USER, ADMIN or OWNER\n  \"type\": \"TECHNICIAN\" //TECHNICIAN, ADMINISTRATION or SELLER\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"users"
							]
						},
						"description": "### Register User\n\nCreates a new user in the system.\n\n**Method:** `POST`  \n**URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/users`\n\n---\n\n> **Permissions / Access Control**  \n> Only users with the role `ADMIN` or `OWNER` are allowed to register a new user.\n\n---\n\n### Request Body (JSON)\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"firstName\": \"{{$randomFirstName}}\",\n  \"lastName\": \"{{$randomLastName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{$randomEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{$randomPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"OWNER\",\n  \"type\": \"TECHNICIAN\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n#### Fields\n\n- `firstName` (string, required)\n    \n    - User's first name.\n        \n    - In this request it is auto-generated using `{{$randomFirstName}}`.\n        \n- `lastName` (string, required)\n    \n    - User's last name.\n        \n    - Auto-generated using `{{$randomLastName}}`.\n        \n- `email` (string, required)\n    \n    - User's email address.\n        \n    - Auto-generated using `{{$randomEmail}}`.\n        \n- `password` (string, required)\n    \n    - User's password.\n        \n    - Auto-generated using `{{$randomPassword}}`.\n        \n- `role` (string, required)\n    \n    - High-level role of the user.\n        \n    - Allowed values: `USER`, `ADMIN`, `OWNER`.\n        \n- `type` (string, required)\n    \n    - Functional type / department of the user.\n        \n    - Allowed values: `TECHNICIAN`, `ADMINISTRATION`, `SELLER`.\n        \n\n---\n\n### Variables Used\n\n- `{{baseUrl}}` – Base URL of the API.\n    \n- `{{$randomFirstName}}` – Dynamic variable used to generate a random first name.\n    \n- `{{$randomLastName}}` – Dynamic variable used to generate a random last name.\n    \n- `{{$randomEmail}}` – Dynamic variable used to generate a random email.\n    \n- `{{$randomPassword}}` – Dynamic variable used to generate a random password.\n    \n\n> Note: Only the description of this request is documented here. The HTTP method, URL, headers, and body remain unchanged.."
					},
					"response": []
				},
